  "content": "\n\n<center>\n\n![Заголовок Fantasy Texture Pack](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kFbEIMmd/images/de0d85b17fe19a99067127b9dbc6f949e508d021.jpeg)\n\n<center><span><strong><font size=\"5\">Fantasy Texture Pack</font></strong></span></center>\n<p></p>\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fantasy-texture-pack\">\n  <img alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-texture-pack\">\n  <img alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\">\n  <img alt=\"Спонсоры GitHub\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/brandonitaly\">\n  <img alt=\"Ko-fi\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<p></p>\n\nПогрузитесь в эпоху, когда рыцари были героями.\n<p></p>\n\nЭтот пакет добавляет средневековый фэнтези-стиль для блоков, предметов, сущностей и интерфейса.\n<p></p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Предпросмотр</summary>\n\n![мир](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kFbEIMmd/images/ffd23d5bcf27ef9393d150d2d041fb5cd842e6f7.jpeg)\n\n![вишнёвая роща](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kFbEIMmd/images/7063dbc217d3c1cb118b86341db61b74a75f4d8c.png)\n\n![корова в биоме равнин](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kFbEIMmd/images/117e320bb53d29d2da5beb9a64ac4a2044ee966d.png)\n\n![разрушенный портал](https://cdn.modrinth.com/dat